sed\"\n  }\n}\n---phases/36-corpus-widen-2/step3-report.json\n{\n  \"keys\": [\n    \"goldens\",\n    \"two_layer_cells\",\n    \"joint_hoop_handling\",\n    \"rules_added\",\n    \"existing_goldens_unchanged\",\n    \"summary\"\n  ],\n  \"goldens\": {\n    \"saiki-fire-p1-girders.json\": {\n      \"main\": 24,\n      \"stirrup\": 24,\n      \"dimension\": 24\n    },\n    \"saiki-fire-p2-columns.json\": {\n      \"cells\": 10\n    }\n  },\n  \"existing_goldens_unchanged\": true\n}\n---phases/36-corpus-widen-2/step4-report.json\n{\n  \"keys\": [\n    \"goldens\",\n    \"rules_added\",\n    \"deferred_decisions\",\n    \"existing_goldens_unchanged\",\n    \"summary\"\n  ],\n  \"goldens\": {\n    \"ina-pump-p7-lists.json\": {\n      \"cells\": 2,\n      \"scopeOutCells\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"passed\"\n    },\n    \"fuji-kanritou-p20-lists.json\": {\n      \"cells\": 7,\n      \"scopeOutCells\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"passed\"\n    },\n    \"karatsu-karayaku-s4-foundation-girders.json\": {\n      \"cells\": 0,\n      \"scopeOutCells\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"passed\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"existing_goldens_unchanged\": true\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"실측값을 확정했습니다. 2차 골든은 격자 7/7면, 階高 3/3면, リスト 5/5면이며, 伏図 발주처는 SOURCES.md 기준 2곳에서 8곳으로 늘어납니다. 이제 R10·R15는 열린 상태로 유지하면서 ADR-045와 문서 대장을 갱신하겠습니다."}}
